---
import Layout from '../layouts/StandardLayout.astro';
import { currentSite } from '../lib/site';
---
{currentSite(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_KEY) === 'agdr' ? <Layout title="Concepts"><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">AgDR concepts</p><h1>Decisions that remain after the session.</h1><p class="lede">AgDR captures a consequential technical decision and its rationale in a portable record.</p><div class="card-grid"><article class="card"><h2>Decision</h2><p>The chosen technical direction.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Rationale</h2><p>The reasons and evidence that support the choice.</p></article></div></section></Layout> : <Layout title="Concepts"><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">ORBIT concepts</p><h1>Durable intent meets current reality.</h1><p class="lede">ORBIT separates what a team wants to achieve from what the repositories show now and what should happen next.</p><div class="card-grid"><article class="card"><h2>Plan</h2><p>What are we trying to achieve?</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Project Snapshot</h2><p>What is true in the repositories now?</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Reconciliation</h2><p>What changed, what remains true, and what should happen next?</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Execution Slice</h2><p>What is the smallest bounded software change justified now?</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Discovery</h2><p>Planning-relevant knowledge learned from observation or execution. A discovery does not automatically become work.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Evidence</h2><p>Traceable support for an assessment.</p></article></div><h2>Durability model</h2><p><strong>Durable:</strong> intent, outcomes, acceptance criteria, constraints.</p><p><strong>Adaptable:</strong> assumptions, decisions, repository relevance, discoveries.</p><p><strong>Disposable:</strong> execution slices, tickets, tasks.</p></section></Layout>}
